	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/mods_settings/prism_rt/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="On graphics cards that trace rays: Shadows casts the sun's shadows of everything on screen and traced ambient occlusion; GI also bounces the light of plasma, muzzle flashes and the sky about the characters; Path Traced traces bounced light at every pixel. The level keeps its own brightness and colours. Off draws the game's own light."/>
		<string text="More rays a pixel: softer, steadier shadows and more of the bounced light, at more of the graphics card's time. Low suits the Steam Deck."/>
		<string text="Half traces a ray for each block of four pixels, cheaper on the graphics card; Full traces each pixel. Auto: full, but at Low quality."/>
		<string text="How the rays are smoothed: Full by their neighbours and the frames before, Temporal by the frames before alone, Off as they are."/>
		<string text="How far the bounced light may move a character's light from the game's own. CE keeps it; Full lets it go up to a quarter brighter or darker."/>
	</strings>
